Hold back enet_peer_disconnect_now() like GFE's reliable disconnect so a queued termination
message is still delivered. Sunshine forks send their end message and disconnect at once.
Applies after host-termination.patch.

diff --git a/src/ControlStream.c b/src/ControlStream.c
